WEBVTT

00:00:00.018 --> 00:00:02.907
Percent of total is a classic window pattern.

00:00:02.907 --> 00:00:05.337
Each sale row remains visible.

00:00:05.337 --> 00:00:09.092
The denominator uses SUM revenue over all rows.

00:00:09.092 --> 00:00:15.417
Dividing the current row revenue by that total produces the row's contribution percentage.

00:00:15.417 --> 00:00:20.552
A GROUP BY would not preserve each individual sale row in the same way.

00:00:20.552 --> 00:00:24.957
GROUP BY collapses rows; PARTITION BY does not.

00:00:24.957 --> 00:00:31.857
That distinction lets you compute group totals, percentages, or rankings while preserving detail.

00:00:31.857 --> 00:00:38.272
For top-N-per-group problems, rank within each group first and then filter the ranked result in an outer

00:00:38.272 --> 00:00:39.309
query.
